sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant API as Transactional API
    participant DB as SQL DB / Outbox
    participant PUB as Outbox Publisher
    participant SB as Service Bus Topic
    participant FN as Azure Function
    participant BLOB as Blob Storage
    participant COS as Cosmos DB

    API->>DB: Commit business change + outbox event
    DB-->>API: Transaction committed
    PUB->>DB: Read pending outbox record
    PUB->>SB: Publish AuditEvent (stable eventId)
    SB-->>PUB: Send accepted
    PUB->>DB: Mark outbox record published
    SB->>FN: Deliver message
    FN->>FN: Validate schema, tenant, eventId
    alt Large payload
        FN->>BLOB: Idempotent write using deterministic blob name
        BLOB-->>FN: Blob reference + optional content hash
        FN->>COS: Create audit document with blob reference
    else Small payload
        FN->>COS: Create audit document with payload
    end
    alt Cosmos create succeeds
        COS-->>FN: Created
        FN->>SB: Complete message
    else Document already exists
        COS-->>FN: Conflict
        FN->>COS: Verify existing event matches eventId/content
        FN->>SB: Complete only if duplicate is confirmed
    else Transient failure
        FN-->>SB: Abandon / allow retry according to policy
    end
